# Model routing

Canonical: `.specs/testing/MODEL-ROUTING.md`

| Tier | Use for |
|------|---------|
| **S0** | Lane runners, merge, lint, grep, boilerplate |
| **S1** | Implementation with clear spec; coordinator handoff + merge |
| **S2** | Specify, design, tasks, trade-offs |
| **S3** | Auth, payments, migrations — escalate only |

**Rules:** Planned at S2 → implement at S1. Implemented at S1 → validate at S0 (isolated runners).
